onceroot ports code from two MIT-licensed projects. Each ported file says so
in its header.

- openwrt-mcp, https://github.com/TAIPANBOX/openwrt-mcp, a fork of
  https://github.com/GlassOnTin/openwrt-mcp.
  Copyright (c) 2026 Ian Williams; additions copyright (c) 2026 Yurii Kostiuk.
  Ported: the held-action store (approval.go), TOTP and lockout (mfa.go),
  PIN hashing (pin.go).
- rollcall, https://github.com/TAIPANBOX/rollcall.
  Copyright (c) 2026 Yurii Kostiuk.
  Ported: Ed25519 helpers (internal/sig), the Telegram sender
  (internal/channel/telegram.go).
